# Dragonologist: "Untapped Dragons you control have hexproof." Bot1 has a Dragon Whelp and the Dragonologist (which takes a
# Lightning Bolt off the top six). On turn 2 Bot2 holds four red mana and a Bolt in hand: the Bolt may not target Bot1's untapped
# Whelp (CR 702.11b) though the mana is there, so Bot2 casts its own Dragon Whelp with it instead. On turn 3 Bot1's Bolt kills
# Bot2's untapped Dragon Whelp, which is not a Dragon Bot1 controls and so has no hexproof.

